{"id": "6c340467f9a28a813485f4e113c6c0e9820bd00a", "text": "Annual Report 2021\nContributions to UNV in 2021\n\nContributions from partners (thousands of US$)\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th rowspan=\"2\">PARTNER COUNTRIES</th>\n    <th>SPECIAL VOLUNTARY FUND</th>\n    <th>OTHER RESOURCES (FULL FUNDING, TRUST FUND, COST-SHARING)</th>\n    <th>TOTAL</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr></tr>\n  <tr><td>Sweden</td><td></td><td>5 676</td><td>5 676</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Republic of Korea</td><td></td><td>4 507</td><td>4 507</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Germany</td><td>3 446</td><td>180</td><td>3 626</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Spain</td><td></td><td>3 479</td><td>3 479</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Switzerland</td><td>865</td><td>1 900</td><td>2 765</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>France</td><td>226</td><td>2 075</td><td>2 301</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Japan</td><td></td><td>1 925</td><td>1 925</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Finland</td><td></td><td>1 556</td><td>1 556</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Ireland</td><td>60</td><td>1 401</td><td>1 461</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Russian Federation</td><td></td><td>1 000</td><td>1 000</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>China</td><td>27</td><td>643</td><td>670</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Czech Republic</td><td>14</td><td>443</td><td>457</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Norway</td><td></td><td>350</td><td>350</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Kazakhstan</td><td>50</td><td></td><td>50</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Bangladesh</td><td>2</td><td></td><td>2</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>Thailand</td><td>1</td><td></td><td>1</td></tr>\n  <tr><th>SUB-TOTAL PARTNER COUNTRIES</th><th>4 690</th><th>25 137</th><th>29 828</th></tr>\n</table>\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>OTHER CONTRIBUTORS</th>\n    <th></th>\n    <th></th>\n    <th></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr><td>Kwansei Gakuin University, Japan</td><td></td><td>83</td><td>83</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>King Mongkut\u2019s University Thonburi, Thailand</td><td></td><td>46</td><td>46</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>PeaceNexus Foundation, Switzerland</td><td></td><td>25</td><td>25</td></tr>\n  <tr><td>UNV Digital Giving (individual donations)</td><td>11</td><td></td><td>11</td></tr>\n  <tr><th>SUB-TOTAL OTHER CONTRIBUTORS</th><th>11</th><th>154</th><th>165</th></tr>\n  <tr><th>GRAND TOTAL</th><th>4 701</th><th>25 292</th><th>29 993</th></tr>\n</table>\n\nIn addition to the above, UNV received the amount of US $798,000 from the Government of Germany in 2021 for the upgrade of the UN Campus Bonn infrastructure. As Premises Manager, UNV administers these funds in line with UNDP Financial Regulations and Rules..", "source": "olmocr", "added": "2026-09-07", "created": "2026-09-07", "metadata": {"Source-File": "/root/gpu/crops_failing/tables//9a61fe7883401ae6a1e4fa506030c59e99ea_pg2__r1.pdf", "olmocr-version": "0.4.27", "pdf-total-pages": 1, "total-input-tokens": 2154, "total-output-tokens": 1104, "total-fallback-pages": 0}, "attributes": {"pdf_page_numbers": [[0, 2337, 1]], "primary_language": ["en"], "is_rotation_valid": [true], "rotation_correction": [0], "is_table": [true], "is_diagram": [false]}}
